=== base ===
# Cleaning Services Agreement

This Agreement is made between Pellmore Facilities Ltd (the "Contractor") and Osric Dental Group Ltd (the "Client").

## 5. Charges
5.1 The Contractor shall invoice the Client on the last working day of each month.
5.2 The Client shall pay each valid invoice within 30 days of receipt.

## 6. Standards
6.1 The Contractor shall clean all treatment rooms every evening.
=== amendment ===
# First Variation

This Variation is dated 3 February 2027 and is made between Pellmore Facilities Ltd (the "Contractor") and Osric Dental Group Ltd (the "Client").

1. Clause 5.2 is amended by deleting the words "30 days" and substituting the words "21 days".
2. All other terms continue unchanged.
